{"id":"bolas","lemma":"bolas","pos":"intj","rank":629,"glosses":["drat, darn; used as an expression of frustration, if something doesn't work out as expected; it is a rather innocent, child-friendly curse"],"ipa":"/ˈbɔ.lɐʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-bolas.wav","examples":[{"text":"Você tem duas bolas.","en":"You have two balls.","words":[{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"deuce","l":"dois"},null]},{"text":"Nenhuma das bolas é amarela.","en":"None of the balls are yellow.","words":[{"g":"not any, none","l":"nenhum"},null,null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"yellow in colour","l":"amarelo"}]},{"text":"Algumas das bolas são amarelas.","en":"Some of the balls are yellow.","words":[{"g":"some, any","l":"algum"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"yellow in colour","l":"amarelo"}]},{"text":"Posso fazer malabarismos com três bolas.","en":"I can juggle three balls.","words":[{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to create"},{"g":"juggling","l":"malabarismo"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Quantas bolas de sorvete você quer?","en":"How many scoops of ice cream do you want?","words":[{"g":"how much","l":"quanto"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sorbet"},{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"}]}]}